<!-- What is Mensa Section -->
<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What is Mensa?</h2>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-brand-accent mx-auto rounded"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Mensa is an international society with one—and only one—qualification for membership: <strong>a score in the top 2% of the general population on a standardized intelligence test.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="mb-6">
          But beyond the IQ score, Mensa is a vibrant, diverse community. We are teachers and technologists, students and retirees, scientists and artists. We share a common curiosity about the world and a desire to connect with others who love to learn, debate, and share ideas.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>GLAAM</strong> (Greater Los Angeles Area Mensa) is your local chapter, bringing the global Mensa experience right to your neighborhood with regular events, Special Interest Groups (SIGs), and lifelong friendships.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="People talking" class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-video">
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-6">
          <p class="text-white font-medium text-lg">"Mensa is where I found my tribe."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

